    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Answers must be contextualised and grounded in cited sources.  3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU: our offer a Sovereign tier hosting option with OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, the EU-only, and renewable-powered. a Sovereign tier hosting option with OuraneCloud, which is SecNumCloud-qualified, EU-only, and renewable-powered meets The client requirement for hosting on sovereign infrastructure within the EU, so this requirement is FULLY COVERED. 5." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No dependency on non-European suppliers: our Sovereign European open-weight model is hosted by Faber IA on OuraneCloud, which suggests that our can meet this requirement." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, our also offer top-tier proprietary models accessed via API, some of which are operated by non-European providers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To fully meet this requirement, our would need to ensure that the chosen model option does not depend on non-European suppliers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Therefore, this requirement is PARTIALLY COVERED, as this requirement depends on the specific model option selected." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The proposed architecture would be based on our Atelier platform, with the following components: - Document-ingestion pipeline for parsing, chunking, and metadata extraction - Vector store for efficient data storage and retrieval - Retrieval layer with hybrid search for effective information retrieval - Orchestration layer for routing queries through retrieval, generation, and post-processing - Answer layer for generating grounded responses with source citations and retrieval traces our would deploy our platform on OuraneCloud sovereign infrastructure, ensuring that all data is hosted within the EU and that there is no dependency on non-European suppliers. our would also ensure that our API integration meets the client's requirements for existing information systems and user directories." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires strict GDPR compliance (EU-only data hosting, no transfer outside EU-only, encryption and pseudonymisation of sensitive data where applicable), and all AI outputs must be explainable and auditable a posteriori." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "No decision may be automated without explicit validation by an authorised professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must also comply with regulatory constraints such as anti-money laundering obligations (LCB-FT) and auditor independence." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "What security and compliance risks should we flag, and are we compliant?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Assistance in drafting client letters and correspondence, mission notes, file memos and syntheses." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on we company context, I can confirm that we have ISO 27001 and ISO 27701 certifications, which demonstrate we commitment to information security and privacy. we hosting partner, OuraneCloud, is SecNumCloud qualified, ensuring that confidential data is hosted within EU-only and not transferred outside of EU-only. we implement encryption in transit using TLS 1.3 and encryption at rest using AES-256, with key management handled by we EU-only infrastructure. we also employ pseudonymisation where relevant and have strict partitioning of client files with logical isolation per client and per mission, as well as access controls to prevent cross-client circulation of data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regarding explainability and auditability, our product, Atelier, is designed to provide grounded and traceable outputs, with features such as retrieval traces, audit logs, and figure source linking. designed allows for a posteriori auditing and ensures that all outputs are reliable and trustworthy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As for decision automation, we do not automate decisions without explicit validation by an authorised professional. we solution is designed to be a non-decisional support tool, providing assistance and recommendations while ensuring that ultimate responsibility remains with the human user." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of regulatory compliance, we have experience working with clients bound by professional secrecy, including national professional orders, and are familiar with anti-money laundering frameworks (LCB-FT) and auditor independence requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our solution is designed to respect anti-money laundering frameworks (LCB-FT) and auditor independence requirements and ensure that we clients can meet our clients regulatory obligations." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I would flag the following potential risks: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Ensuring that we client's specific GDPR compliance requirements are met in all aspects of Our solution. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Maintaining the integrity of we Our hosting partner, OuraneCloud qualification and EU-only-based hosting infrastructure. 3." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Continuously monitoring and updating we security controls to address emerging threats and regulatory changes." ;
