    <http://example.org/node/chunk83> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's PM methodologies, past public sector references, consortium partners, available capacity, and governance practices as of 2024, what are the potential risks and opportunities in the project, and how can our company's ensure that our company's proposal meets all the requirements?" ;
