    <http://example.org/node/chunk84> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, Faber IA, I identify the potential risks and opportunities in this project  Risks include the need to ensure strict confidentiality and comply with legal retention and archival obligations for accounting documents, which is a critical requirement. our company's past experience working with regulated organizations, such as a national professional order and a regional hospital group, demonstrates our company's ability to handle sensitive information." ;
