        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk88> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Opportunities in the project include the chance to improve process efficiency and provide service to the client, which aligns with our company's flagship product, Atelier. our company's sovereign platform can forge document-grounded AI assistants from the client's own documents, enhancing document-grounded AI assistants productivity and reliability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure our proposal meets all requirements, our company's will leverage our company's hybrid delivery model, combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure. our hybrid delivery model, combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure will enable our company's to work closely with the client, adapt to changing needs, and deliver a solution that meets the client expectations. our company's consortium partners, such as OuraneCloud and Ligeo Conseil, can provide valuable support in areas like hosting, integration, and change management. our company's will also draw on our company's experience working with public sector organizations to ensure that our company's solution complies with relevant regulations and standards." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

